{"version":1,"content":"<p>動物保護組織PETA敦促英偉達掌門人黃仁勳告別標誌性的黑色皮夾克，並已給這位億萬富翁寄去一件價值875美元的替代款。新夾克使用以橄欖採收廢棄物製成的皮革替代材料。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588210.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T10:03:52.153937+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":86,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:46:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:57:14.240428+00:00","content_hash":"58ee649689364b0036c14fb5d70dda93a945685d86888301440525b4eaedfdb6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}